Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 19:54:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(images): switch chat image compression from JPEG to
 WebP with JPEG fallback

- ImageUtils: WEBP_QUALITY=80, data:image/webp prefix, encodeWithLadder() tries
  WebP first and falls back to JPEG if the encoder returns empty on a device;
  base64ToBitmap/isImagePayload now accept any data:image/* (legacy JPEG stays readable)
- ImageCache: neutral .img extension for cache files (webp/jpeg by signature)
- ChatLogActivity: transfer 'mime' field derived from the actual data-URI prefix
- README: document WebP migration
